uty industry creating  two types of nail polish for nicole by  opi  she received 100 000 for her endorsement  of the brand she then ventured into  jewelry design along with her sister  kendall they also invested in shoes  handbags and hair extensions  by then kylie had built up a massive fan  base and a very engaged audience  she gained a lot of experience in  business and had great success selling  products for other people and various  brands so she decided to create her own  products to sell she was always insecure  about her lips being too small and thin  that was where the idea of kylie's lip  kit came from she turned her biggest  insecurity into a business opportunity  in 2014 at the age of 18 kylie partnered  with seed beauty a company that was  newly founded by laura thomas  the company was specifically built to  develop and manufacture global beauty  brands with a focus on speed and  efficiency of product development  this allowed them to beat other  companies to market  kylie teamed up with the company and  started developing and manufacturing her  lip kit  her lip kit included a lipstick and a  matching lip liner initially a limited  batch of only 15 000 kits were made  after teasing and hyping up her lip kit  through social media in november of 2015  kylie launched her product online and  put the lip kits up for sale at a very  affordable price of 29 per kit  being the face of her brand she was able  to leverage her social media following  which essentially gave her free  advertising saving her millions in  advertising costs  with manufacturing outsourced to seed  beauty as well as utilizing the online  e-commerce platform shopify  she was able to improve the logistics of  her business and reach more customers to  generate more sales she only needed to  hire seven full-time employees  much of jenna's work on kylie cosmetics  took place on social media  she frequently promoted the brand on her  personal instagram account being the ceo  of kylie cosmetics 