m being embarrassed about being  caught in a lie she and her mother chris  seized it as a marketing opportunity and  started kylie cosmetics  critics say her billion may be a big lie  the self-made billionaire kylie jenner  allegedly inflated the size of her  cosmetics business for years forbes  reported that kylie's business was  significantly smaller and less  profitable than previously thought  the report cited public files released  by beauty giant coty which bought half  of jenna's company as evidence that the  22 year old entrepreneur had  consistently lied about her fortune  forbes also claimed that her family went  as far as creating tax returns that were  lightly forged in a desperate attempt to  look richer than they already were  moreover they claimed that the business  was never that big to begin with and  that jenners have lied about it every  year since 2016  including having their accountant draft  tax returns with false numbers to help  juice estimates of kylie's earnings and  net worth  forbes claimed that while they can't  prove that those documents were fake  they reported it's clear that kylie's  cap has been lying  there's also the issue of profit forbes  had been estimating that her business  which has little overhead was netting 44  net margins  but coty's filings indicate that kylie's  profits are likely lower at only around  25 net margins  the financial magazine garnered  widespread criticism in march 2019 when  it declared jenna the world's youngest  self-made billionaire a controversial  label given the weight of her last name  and the massive platform it provides she  defended herself on twitter stating that  she never asked for any title or tried  to lie her way there ever but experts  who spoke with the magazine believe  jenna's company was never as big as she  claimed it was  most recently her net worth has been  estimated to be around 700 million  dollars  even though she lost her spot in forbes  list of billionaires she still has a 